WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.375 --> 00:00:03.142
Unit eleven. Reading Labels!

2
00:00:04.106 --> 00:00:07.764
Hello, everyone! I'm Nurse Bopha, your school nurse.

3
00:00:07.814 --> 00:00:11.697
Hi, Nurse Bopha! What do we learn today?

4
00:00:11.747 --> 00:00:15.564
Today we learn about Reading Labels. Let's go!

5
00:00:16.404 --> 00:00:19.804
Label. Say it with me. Label!

6
00:00:23.333 --> 00:00:27.683
Serving size. Say it with me. Serving size!

7
00:00:31.181 --> 00:00:34.781
Sugar. Say it with me. Sugar!

8
00:00:38.268 --> 00:00:41.818
Sodium. Say it with me. Sodium!

9
00:00:45.302 --> 00:00:49.502
Ingredients. Say it with me. Ingredients!

10
00:00:53.002 --> 00:00:56.802
Calories. Say it with me. Calories!

11
00:01:00.302 --> 00:01:04.068
Compare. Say it with me. Compare!

12
00:01:07.570 --> 00:01:11.003
Choice. Say it with me. Choice!

13
00:01:14.503 --> 00:01:25.227
A food label shows serving size, calories, sugar, and sodium. The ingredients are listed from most to least. I compare labels to make a healthier choice.

14
00:01:25.277 --> 00:01:26.717
I can do that too!

15
00:01:28.136 --> 00:01:33.438
Look! What's the word?

16
00:01:33.488 --> 00:01:34.638
Sugar!

17
00:01:35.527 --> 00:01:40.535
Look! What's the word?

18
00:01:40.585 --> 00:01:41.735
Compare!

19
00:01:42.788 --> 00:01:46.736
Did you know? Sodium is the word used on labels for salt!

20
00:01:46.786 --> 00:01:48.996
Wow! I did not know that!

21
00:01:50.386 --> 00:01:58.115
Think and answer. Why does the order of ingredients matter?

22
00:01:58.165 --> 00:01:59.315
Great answer!

23
00:02:00.386 --> 00:02:05.242
Great job today! Stay healthy, and see you next time. Goodbye!

24
00:02:05.292 --> 00:02:07.858
Goodbye, everyone! Stay healthy!

